Description: shared field and unit management for scientific computing
 A Python package for managing physical fields and units in scientific
 computing applications. Provides type-safe field definitions with
 integrated unit conversion, flexible lookup registries, and a library
 of standard scientific fields.
 .
 Features include:
  - Type-safe Field class backed by pint units
  - FieldRegistry with name/symbol/alias lookup
  - Unit conversion for single values and arrays
  - Plot label generation with optional LaTeX rendering
  - Domain-specific region exclusions
  - Pre-defined fields for electromagnetic, thermal, hydraulic, and
    mechanical physics domains
  - Backwards-compatible helpers for dict-based field definitions
